://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/c5/nnjcyhntzc767iwai1i5xktkirxxwus.png/120px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E7%A5%9D%E7%A6%8F%E4%B9%8B%E7%9F%A2.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/c/c5/nnjcyhntzc767iwai1i5xktkirxxwus.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />猎杀意志\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:60%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>行动结束时，对自身范围<font color=\"red\">3</font>格内最近的敌人，造成<font color=\"red\">20%</font>物理伤害，施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"倒吊人标记\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">倒吊人标记</font></span></span>]。攻击拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"倒吊人标记\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">倒吊人标记</font></span></span>]的敌人时，伤害提高<font color=\"red\">10%</font>。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><b>该个性属于</b><br /><br /><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:90px;height:90px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%80%92%E5%90%8A%E4%BA%BA%E7%89%B9%E5%B7%A5\" title=\"角色图鉴库/倒吊人特工\"><img alt=\"头像 倒吊人特工.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/0/09/hbpfn4ge9ag5ckbx4rn5pm48139tsfi.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:90px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">倒吊人特工</font></div>\n</div><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:90px;height:90px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%80%92%E5%90%8A%E4%BA%BA%E2%80%9C%E5%85%B5%E8%9C%82%E2%80%9D\" title=\"角色图鉴库/倒吊人“兵蜂”\"><img alt=\"头像 倒吊人“兵蜂”.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/3/31/5u7gxie38nvq3m34rusgcctlrgqs9fh.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:90px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">倒吊人“兵蜂”</font></div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>行动结束时，对自身范围<font color=\"red\">3</font>格内最近的敌人，造成<font color=\"red\">25%</font>物理伤害，施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"倒吊人标记\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">倒吊人标记</font></span></span>]。攻击拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"倒吊人标记\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">倒吊人标记</font></span></span>]的敌人时，伤害提高<font color=\"red\">10%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk0